option.SOUL_FIRE_SPECTRAL=Soul Fire Swan Plasma
option.SOUL_FIRE_SPECTRAL.comment=Simulates high-energy ionized Swan-band molecular radical emissions (cyan/blue plasma) for soul fire.
option.FIRE_EMBERS=Floating Micro-Embers
option.FIRE_EMBERS.comment=Detached glowing sparks break off from flame tips and drift upward in thermal updrafts.
option.CINEMATIC_SCREEN_FIRE=Peripheral Screen Fire Vignette
option.CINEMATIC_SCREEN_FIRE.comment=Replaces the blinding vanilla screen fire with a cinematic heat vignette hugging screen edges while keeping the center view clear.
option.SCREEN_FIRE_OPACITY=Screen Fire Intensity
option.SCREEN_FIRE_OPACITY.comment=Overall opacity and radiance of camera peripheral fire overlay.

